<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 5 bln levs 27-day discount T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 5 bln levs 27-day discount T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed a special issue of 27-day discount T-bills worth five billion levs and yielding 14.74 percent to maturity, the central bank said.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the central bank did not say with which financial intitution or institutions the issue was placed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Details of issue follow. Price in percent of par. </p>
<p> Issue number		  BG3027797003</p>
<p> Type			    discount</p>
<p> Term			    27 days</p>
<p> Issue date		    April 9</p>
<p> Maturity date		 May 6</p>
<p> Par value		     5.0 bln levs</p>
<p> Selling price		 87.15 pct</p>
<p> Yield to maturity	   14.74 pct</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
